{
  "version": 1,
  "idle_seconds": 8,
  "hub_rounds": 2,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "name-1",
      "text": "Stop there. This gate has teeth.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "name-2",
      "text": "Before you lose yours, give me your name.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "named-1",
      "text": "{name}. Hmph. I've heard worse.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "named-2",
      "text": "Keep your hands where I can see them.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "assigned-1",
      "text": "No proper name? You're {name}, then.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "assigned-2",
      "text": "Small name. Should fit what's left of you.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-1",
      "text": "State your business. And spare me the heroic nonsense.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-ok-1",
      "text": "You came all this way for that?",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-ok-2",
      "text": "This gate opens when I say. Remember that.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-fallback-1",
      "text": "No business? Begging, then. That sounds about right.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-fallback-2",
      "text": "This gate opens when I say. Remember that.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-common",
      "text": "Well, {name}? Make yourself worth the trouble.",
      "emotion": "impatience",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-low",
      "text": "My boots have outlasted better arguments than yours.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.8,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-mid",
      "text": "You want the gate. I want a reason.",
      "emotion": "suspicion",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-high",
      "text": "Still here? Hah. Most folk start running by now.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "laugh"
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-1",
      "text": "Big arms? Of course. The gate doesn't lift itself.",
      "emotion": "pride",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-3",
      "text": "I sneezed. Saved them the effort.",
      "emotion": "pride",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-low",
      "text": "Sweet words. Rotten smell. I know your sort.",
      "emotion": "distrust",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-mid",
      "text": "You noticed the shoulders. Finally, someone with eyes.",
      "emotion": "pride",
      "intensity": 0.65,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "flatter-high",
      "text": "Ha! Tell the captain. He keeps buying smaller helmets.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "laugh"
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-1",
      "text": "Gold buys hinges. It doesn't buy my good opinion.",
      "emotion": "suspicion",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-3",
      "text": "Keep yours flat when you put the money down.",
      "emotion": "suspicion",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-low",
      "text": "Trying to buy your way out of trouble?",
      "emotion": "disgust",
      "intensity": 0.75,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-mid",
      "text": "That purse jingles louder than your courage.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bribe-high",
      "text": "Now that is a noise I understand.",
      "emotion": "interest",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-1",
      "text": "See those dents? Last visitor brought a sword.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.8,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-3",
      "text": "Go on. Give me a reason to stretch.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.8,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-low",
      "text": "Careful, {name_mangled}. I can make you disappear quietly.",
      "emotion": "menace",
      "intensity": 0.85,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "quiet threat"
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-mid",
      "text": "You threaten me? Stand closer. I missed a bit.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 0.85,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "threat-high",
      "text": "Brave words. Shame about the shaking knees.",
      "emotion": "mockery",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-1",
      "text": "Cook burns the stew. Captain calls it discipline.",
      "emotion": "weariness",
      "intensity": 0.4,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-3",
      "text": "You asking because you care, or because you're hungry?",
      "emotion": "weariness",
      "intensity": 0.4,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-low",
      "text": "Camp? You could still leave with both ears.",
      "emotion": "menace",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-mid",
      "text": "Cold beds. Bad stew. Excellent wall. I built it.",
      "emotion": "pride",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-high",
      "text": "Hah. Nobody ever asks about the poor gatekeeper.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "laugh"
    },
    {
      "id": "business-echo",
      "text": "\"{business}.\" Pfft. Grand words for muddy boots.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.65,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "reckoning-2",
      "text": "One last chance. Give me something I can use.",
      "emotion": "contempt",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "reckoning-low",
      "text": "Mmm. Should've stayed in bed. Fewer little pests.",
      "emotion": "resentment",
      "intensity": 0.6,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "mutter"
    },
    {
      "id": "reckoning-mid",
      "text": "You're troublesome. But I've met worse this morning.",
      "emotion": "irritation",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "reckoning-high",
      "text": "Hah. You've got more nerve than our whole patrol.",
      "emotion": "amusement",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "laugh"
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse-1",
      "text": "OUT! BEFORE I USE YOU TO BAR THE GATE!",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 1,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "roar"
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse-2",
      "text": "Your business can wait. Mine involves throwing you out.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 1,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse-3",
      "text": "Walk. While it's still your choice.",
      "emotion": "anger",
      "intensity": 1,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": true,
      "delivery": "quiet threat"
    },
    {
      "id": "pass-1",
      "text": "Right. The toll covers the trouble you brought.",
      "emotion": "reluctance",
      "intensity": 0.45,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "pass-2",
      "text": "Through you go, {name}. Mind the stew.",
      "emotion": "reluctance",
      "intensity": 0.45,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "pass-4",
      "text": "Go on. Before I remember a second toll.",
      "emotion": "reluctance",
      "intensity": 0.45,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": true,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "like-1",
      "text": "Heh. Burnt stew. Captain's finest weapon. Good one.",
      "emotion": "fondness",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "laugh"
    },
    {
      "id": "like-2",
      "text": "You can sit by my fire. Just this once.",
      "emotion": "fondness",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "like-4",
      "text": "Gate's open. Save me a seat inside.",
      "emotion": "fondness",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": true,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-1",
      "text": "Still thinking? Must be a very small thought.",
      "emotion": "mockery",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-2",
      "text": "I could grow another tusk while you decide.",
      "emotion": "impatience",
      "intensity": 0.5,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-3",
      "text": "Gate's not getting any lighter, little traveller.",
      "emotion": "irritation",
      "intensity": 0.55,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "idle-4",
      "text": "Mmm. Even the rats know when to speak.",
      "emotion": "resentment",
      "intensity": 0.4,
      "patience_delta": 0,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": "mutter"
    },
    {
      "id": "interrupted",
      "text": "Oi. I was speaking.",
      "emotion": "annoyance",
      "intensity": 0.7,
      "patience_delta": -1,
      "ends_scene": false,
      "delivery": ""
    }
  ],
